  "description": "Market is annoying...but not bad.",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Monday! Stock market has been annoying the past few weeks…but nothing bad. Nothing has “broke”…the VIX and DXY continue to trend in our favor and most stocks continue to form higher lows. Heck, even <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SPY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> made an all time high just last Friday. So even though sentiment and price action has been….not exciting…nothing is making me press the worry button like back in November and December of 2024. </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
